# Q-5: a type-3 continuation chunk of a message with an extended timestamp carries the 4 byte field on the wire
# (the engine itself sends it), but ReadPacket does not consume it, so the stream desynchronises.
new
clock 1000
seturl rtmp://h/a
enablewrite
set flashver FMLE
feed 03
feed_s1 0 1000 00000000
feed_echo
connect
feed 
read
read
read
state
